  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x200b;&#x200b;Strengthening onboarding and awareness for internal migrant workers in Viet Nam&#x2019;s electronics sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implemented through a partnership between International Organization for Migration (IOM) and Google LLC, this project seeks to improve workplace onboarding and support for internal migrant workers, particularly ethnic minorities, employed by Google&apos;s suppliers in Viet Nam. The project strengthens suppliers&apos; capacity to embed inclusive worker support within human resources practices, fostering long-term and systemic change. It will develop accessible, worker-centred resources to increase awareness of labour rights, entitlements, and support services among workers in Viet Nam&apos;s industrial zones, contributing to safer, more inclusive, and rights-based workplaces.</narrative>
  </description>
